          "type": "label",
          "text": "<b style=\"color:#7dd3fc\">PHYSICAL LOOPBACK</b>  DP932A CH1 (+/−) → DM858 voltage input (COM/V).  DG902 Pro CH1 → MHO954 CH1 (direct BNC / 1 MΩ).<br><b style=\"color:#ffb98a\">LIVE OUTPUTS:</b> PSU CH1 ramps 5.00 → 2.00 V at 0.25 V intervals; GEN CH1 runs sine and square at 1/2 Vpp, 1/5 kHz. Both verified OFF on cleanup. Never connect PSU output to generator output; verify wiring/grounding and instrument limits before RUN.",
